{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "a2bbe27bc1c646899af574fa9bb7b70b05c4cde8b8697d9607d1070e6b8b9ff6", "ja": "あ！　ウワサをすれば……\n{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊！才刚在说，人就到了……\n{$P$}先生，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2544b2a7ac177dcf177632dfa570340fc343602a60bba400d190052fcea73ff7", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。\n今日はポカポカしてて、春らしいですね。", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。\n今天的天气暖洋洋的，很有春天的气息呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "e9dcc17564900f60e45184bfdadc9ad852afc26198407c3e76a0375abce4f04e", "ja": "本当にそうですよね！\n花壇のお花も、綺麗に咲きましたし。", "zh": "就是说啊！\n花圃的花也开得非常漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c473625fe2c5b5e7e273a73cdaa23a2df6b9f481dd844be3a538e36043421aed", "ja": "そういえば、可愛いピンク色の花が咲いていましたね。\nあの花は、なんていう名前なんですか？", "zh": "说到这个，那里开着可爱的粉红色花朵呢。\n你知道那种花叫什么名字吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "4d84d850dd279b4492f8eabce5cb1ba46664c54d88b34defbb62fa8ce2ee3934", "ja": "それが、私も知らなくて。今度、\nひなたちゃんに聞いてみようかなって……あっ！", "zh": "其实我也不晓得，\n我下次问问日向好了……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "cc6e886e9902cfae3cb870afffe0339234c3b0879c9b20595ebb8670525cf7fa", "ja": "また忘れちゃうところでした。あの、社長さんが\nお呼びなんです。事務所に寄ってみてください！", "zh": "我差点又忘了！那个，社长在找你，\n要麻烦你去事务所一趟了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3358a8d2fce7f041ad9dd7e345238e9176a4da110ea88840cfbc3a7538fdb998", "ja": "そうでしたか。\nありがとうございます、さっそく行ってみます！", "zh": "这样啊，\n谢谢你的通知，我马上过去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "4b0b7ee759a9a74a063cdceaf5c63972aa553d85d2d97c54fb5604f3e5f864cc", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さん、\nいってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "好的！{$P$}先生，\n请慢走～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1008_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "bd1243bfdc37d6473d4fc280e43942cbe40a971747e3ddb099ba0177e029976f", "ja": "失礼します。社長、\n音無さん、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "打扰了。\n社长、音无小姐，两位辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "442085a5e201b6dd8e1909f8be3e47fb30ada0c1e7c83bddb6b22db281d8e0bc", "ja": "おはよう！　君。\nうむ、あいかわらず元気そうだね！", "zh": "你来啦，早啊！\n嗯，你还是老样子，很有活力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "d4368e07f101b672fc874060ad783e63e36c9ff6b44885155404ddcb95780655", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b59f9facbf1e5194e9f0ed156b5336d50a9b9cca82f67fceed0a0a6db5d50d17", "ja": "事務所の入り口の花、綺麗ですね。\n劇場の花壇と同じ花でしたけど、あれは……。", "zh": "事务所门口的花很漂亮呢。\n跟剧场花圃的花好像是同一种品种，那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "161ada0a8bba004219ac75df68ead205e1581b75518670a1a770d87f618f00b1", "ja": "まぁ、気づいてくださったんですね？\nあれは去年、ひなたちゃんと一緒に植えたんです。", "zh": "哎呀，你注意到了呀？\n那是去年我和日向一起种的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "234055a4839fa660080efd76988674d0dfc272a227ffeffeed821aa53c9d8a17", "ja": "綺麗に咲いたので、プランターに\n少し植え替えて、もらってきたんです♪", "zh": "因为开得很漂亮，我就把一些移到盆栽，\n拿来这边放了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a3190c5c58ff98eddf643a62b4028d279a40d33a9c259b0f8e869a69f0b55d43", "ja": "そうだったんですか。それにしても、花があると\n場が華やかになりますね。なんていう花なんですか？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。话说回来，放了花之后，\n这里就变得春意盎然了呢。这是什么花呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "330436d0307d9cee3cf23fbfd438bafc7ce748cc30a7881ee1d652805a7768df", "ja": "『プリムラ』っていう名前の花なんです。\n花言葉は……ふふっ。", "zh": "这种花叫做『报春花』，\n花语是……呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "86fae369f419c7709f42afadaa654422a4a2e052dd8e094146ddb614847e685c", "ja": "音無さん……？", "zh": "音无小姐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "9218a5e887f027ce556ce35ab30099d2933d724cc53f92a233662808aafa0c9c", "ja": "うふ、うふふ……っ。そんな、もう……\n{$P$}さんったら。うふっ♪", "zh": "呵呵、呵呵……！唉唷，真是的……\n{$P$}先生你喔，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "6a71d8edad901965bda99d1304dcb0050ca56bb24f27f2286631b7cdc45c8d25", "ja": "ははは。春の陽気にあてられて、\n音無君も、さらに陽気になっているようだね！", "zh": "哈哈哈，看来春天的好天气\n也让音无比平时更开朗了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "df3a3c0d88e38d04039a9552b8f7e5933ab6a8a72a084596bb2d7dedbfeacece", "ja": "ええ、そうですね。暖かいですからね！", "zh": "嗯嗯，是啊，谁叫天气这么暖和呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "0fb2abae2794fca2a921028157228cf901f915806cfa6a4204a5adeb1655c7c1", "ja": "今日は君に、そんな\n春のぽかぽか陽気みたいな話があるのだよ。", "zh": "今天找你来，就是想跟你说\n一件不输给春日暖意的好消息喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7d5480bcde09beaff3fa4948ea338ae3483c7fe5201bb8dcbd05b9397ad4833e", "ja": "はい！　なんでしょう？", "zh": "好的！请问是什么事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "8efe8b300a76ba255165d7167f0fe80a0699552aac81dba5b8af4daad87ffab7", "ja": "君が出してくれた、次回の天体公演の企画書、\nじっくり読ませてもらった。うむ、やはりいいね！", "zh": "关于下次的天体公演，我已经好好看过\n你提的企划书了。嗯，果然很不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "faa9f7aaaf35ab5cfd70d2e515efd1e55c5a277db45d0ba5e73bed37e24e6841", "ja": "実は、この公演にピッタリだと思う曲が、\n私の手元に届いてね……。聴いてくれるかな？", "zh": "其实呢，我手边收到了一首歌，\n觉得那很适合这场公演……你有兴趣听听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "ed082d3f296172354acd9b76bf63307f767405c39f807c41b1e5cfb0cb35d892", "ja": "もちろんです！　ぜひ聴かせてください。", "zh": "这是当然！请务必让我听听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "6590a192f13cd7592a9dc9c0b4107d86b867f534803aea6bbeb9f819175cfa47", "ja": "これは……可愛らしい曲ですね！\n可愛らしいのに、さわやかさもあって……。", "zh": "这首歌……真是可爱呢！\n而且在可爱中又不失清爽活力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "011533a6fd546b1ec24d101e04eee3325de53a874427b3ce53b955be2e7f2908", "ja": "そうだろう！　君の企画書を読んで、\n私もピーンときたんだよ。", "zh": "是吧！看了你的企划书后，\n我马上就想到了这首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "cbdf57a8e7927b345bc13cd944c6aa68d5ca40bc2b0735e345b58a9bb978d4ed", "ja": "はい、イメージにぴったりです！\nさっそく、3人に伝えようと思います！", "zh": "没错，两者的形象非常相符！\n我想马上把这个消息告诉她们三个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "2f226b80026d7e59d2722b7e76b3082233e95b1d14716a30b65eb7e052dcb60d", "ja": "メンバーは、昴ちゃんと静香ちゃん、それに\n百合子ちゃんでしたっけ。きっと、喜ぶと思いますよ！", "zh": "这次演出的成员是小昴、静香，\n还有百合子对吧，我想她们一定会很开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "653da72dadee205c12287d0358de1d2e5fd7d5021142094c4b925549fc5d29c8", "ja": "うむ、それじゃあ君、今回も頑張ってくれたまえ。\n期待しているよ！", "zh": "嗯，那你这次也要好好努力，\n我很期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
